{"kind": "mod", "id": 1804, "name": "Get Concussed", "slug": "get-concussed", "teaser": "Adds the concussion and tinnitus effect to players when helmets receive headshots.", "owner_name": "penguingreentea", "downloads": 5030, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:59:02.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-10-29T16:28:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-10-29T16:28:15.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h3><strong>Showcase</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"XwLT6shnSDs\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XwLT6shnSDs?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XwLT6shnSDs/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p>Headshots will trigger the concussion/tinnitus effects if the bullet is blocked by helmet armor.</p>\n<p>Like Live EFT, tinnitus will only occur if you do not have a headset equipped.</p>\n<h3><strong>Install</strong></h3>\n<p>Extract directly into the SPT folder. The plugin can be located in BepInEx/plugins/.</p>\n<h3><strong>Background</strong></h3>\n<p>Concussions/tinnitus caused by gunshots to the helmet are currently not working. This mod restores the effect, for concussion lovers like myself.</p>\n<h3><strong>Configuration</strong></h3>\n<p>Hit F12 to configure concussion duration and concussion strength (default: 0.75 strength and 5 seconds duration), as well as turning tinnitus on/off.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.8", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1303, "published_at": "2024-10-31T06:21:13.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1804/get-concussed/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3365, "published_at": "2024-11-29T00:30:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1804/get-concussed/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["ibxccc123/SPT-GetConcussed"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/ibxccc123/SPT-GetConcussed", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}